NYLON WHEEL- 1"

1 ROLLER PER PACKAGE

Designed for both inswing and outswing BiltBest patio doors, these weather strip seals help prevent air leaks around doors and operable windows. Enhance your home's energy efficiency by sealing gaps and reducing drafts with these high-quality weatherstrip seals.

